This repository contains a porting layer for Fluent Bit: patches, build scripts and
plugins that adapt Fluent Bit to QNX 8.0. It does not contain Fluent Bit source code.

Fluent Bit is a Cloud Native Computing Foundation (CNCF) project, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, and is the work of the Fluent Bit authors and
contributors: https://github.com/fluent/fluent-bit

The patches in patches/ are changes to Fluent Bit and are offered under the same
license as Fluent Bit (Apache-2.0). Each patch carries a Signed-off-by line
(Developer Certificate of Origin), as Fluent Bit requires.

